          <rdf:li>Catra &amp; Scorpia (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra &amp; Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra &amp; Shadow Weaver | Light Spinner (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora &amp; Catra &amp; Shadow Weaver | Light Spinner (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Shadow Weaver | Light Spinner (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
